{"id":"0c3cbeaaa31fd355","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-randomness-extractor.md","title":"df-randomness-extractor","display":"df-randomness-extractor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-randomness-extractor","aliases":["28-df-randomness-extractor"],"display":"df-randomness-extractor","depends_on":["[[28-df-min-entropy]]","[[28-df-statistical-distance]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 21.24; printed p.444; PDF p.470","source_printed_pages":"444","source_pdf_pages":"470","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-randomness-extractor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-randomness-extractor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-randomness-extractor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f79df9244d067310\" href=\"?note=f79df9244d067310\" title=\"28-df-min-entropy\">28-df-min-entropy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09af003dd1fefc1b\" href=\"?note=09af003dd1fefc1b\" title=\"28-df-statistical-distance\">28-df-statistical-distance</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 21.24; printed p.444; PDF p.470"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"444"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"470"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,d,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,d,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[0,n]\">\\(k\\in[0,n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\epsilon\\in[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^d\\to\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^d\\to\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\">\\(\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f79df9244d067310\" href=\"?note=f79df9244d067310\" title=\"28-df-min-entropy\">28-df-min-entropy</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09af003dd1fefc1b\" href=\"?note=09af003dd1fefc1b\" title=\"28-df-statistical-distance\">28-df-statistical-distance</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}^j\">\\(\\{0,1\\}^j\\)</span> 上均匀分布，每次出现的源 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 与种子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_d\">\\(U_d\\)</span> 相互独立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}(\\operatorname{Ext};k,\\epsilon)\">\\(\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}(\\operatorname{Ext};k,\\epsilon)\\)</span> 为带种子的提取器谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}(\\operatorname{Ext};k,\\epsilon)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\;\\Delta\\bigl(\\operatorname{Ext}(X,U_d),U_m\\bigr)\\le\\epsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}(\\operatorname{Ext};k,\\epsilon)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\;\\Delta\\bigl(\\operatorname{Ext}(X,U_d),U_m\\bigr)\\le\\epsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义 21.24 不要求提取器高效计算；显式提取器另加算法条件。种子独立且均匀是必要前提。此处为普通提取器，保留种子后的联合分布结论另由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"97a794aef4eec69f\" href=\"?note=97a794aef4eec69f\" title=\"28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma\">28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma</a> 给出；该语义差异没有合并。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-min-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"f79df9244d067310","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-min-entropy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-statistical-distance","status":"resolved","id":"09af003dd1fefc1b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-statistical-distance]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-min-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"f79df9244d067310","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-min-entropy]]，$\\Delta$ 见 [[28-df-statistical-distance]]。$U_j$ 为 $\\{0,1\\}^j$ 上均匀分布，每次出现的源 $X$ 与种子 $U_d$ 相互独立。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-statistical-distance","status":"resolved","id":"09af003dd1fefc1b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-min-entropy]]，$\\Delta$ 见 [[28-df-statistical-distance]]。$U_j$ 为 $\\{0,1\\}^j$ 上均匀分布，每次出现的源 $X$ 与种子 $U_d$ 相互独立。","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"97a794aef4eec69f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"定义 21.24 不要求提取器高效计算；显式提取器另加算法条件。种子独立且均匀是必要前提。此处为普通提取器，保留种子后的联合分布结论另由 [[28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma]] 给出；该语义差异没有合并。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,d,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[0,n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^d\\to\\{0,1\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}^j","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"U_d","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}(\\operatorname{Ext};k,\\epsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}(\\operatorname{Ext};k,\\epsilon)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\;\\Delta\\bigl(\\operatorname{Ext}(X,U_d),U_m\\bigr)\\le\\epsilon.","display":true}],"bytes":1384,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-226","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：熵与提取器：[[28-df-min-entropy]]、[[28-df-randomness-extractor]]、[[28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma]]。"},{"id":"575e49f7e8ce8f6f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$k\\in[0,n]$；$G=(2^n,2^r,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{2^n,2^r}$ 且 $\\lambda(G)\\le\\alpha<1$，$\\alpha\\ge0$。图、游走和谱界见 [[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]。$\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}$、$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$、统计距离 $\\Delta$ 见 [[28-df-randomness-extractor]] 及其上游。字串下标从1开始；$z\\in\\{0,1\\}^{rt}$ 唯一分成长度 $r$ 的块 $z^{(1)},\\ldots,z^{(t)}$。对所有 $j\\in\\mathbb N$ 定义 $b_j$；$\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^{rt}\\to\\{0,1\\}^n$ 和 $\\epsilon_{n,k,t}$ 由下式定义；$b_j^{-1}$ 为双射的逆，$\\alpha^0=1$。$X$ 与均匀种子 $U_{rt}$ 独立。"}],"outgoing":["f79df9244d067310","09af003dd1fefc1b","97a794aef4eec69f"]}